n straight hair with air bangs, wearing silver headband. Outfit: white lace-trimmed camisole with thin straps, light gray knit cardigan with textured sleeves, letter H pendant necklace. Red in-ear headphones with visible cable. Left hand supporting chin in relaxed pose, sitting in mesh office chair.\n\nFOREGROUND: Professional silver condenser microphone with shock mount and boom arm stand on right side, positioned near her face.\n\nBACKGROUND SETTING: Cozy streaming room with pastel purple and pink ambient lighting. Left side: pink teddy bear plushie on white cabinet, glass vase with pink flowers, small warm lamp. Right side: large white bunny plush with ears, warm yellow fairy string lights creating bokeh effect. Wall decoration: framed art with \"Believe\" text in handwritten font. Clean, organized setup.\n\nLIGHTING & ATMOSPHERE: Soft ring light illumination on face, even lighting without harsh shadows, dreamy shallow depth of field, lavender and rose gold color palette, healing vibe, kawaii aesthetic.\n\nPLATFORM UI OVERLAY - TOP BAR: \n- Left: Circular streamer avatar, username \"小鹿吖\", \"10.2 万本场点赞\" text, pink \"关注\" follow button\n- Center-right: Three small circular avatars showing other streamers with viewer counts (1.2w, 1.0w, 8560)\n- Right: \"1.5 万\" viewer count display, X close button\n- Yellow badge: \"小时榜第 5 名\" ranking indicator\n- Purple banner: \"展馆限时挑战 3/7\" challenge progress\n\nMIDDLE SECTION - DANMU & GIFTS:\n- Floating gift notifications with user avatars: \"梦里花落 送出小心心 x1\" with pink heart icon, \"甜心小熊 送出玫瑰 x1\" with red rose icon\n- Scrolling comment bullets in colored backgrounds (purple, blue, gold): messages like \"主播唱歌好好听~\", \"你今天好美呀\", \"关注了主播\", \"主播声音好好听，能点一首歌吗？\"\n- User level badges and fan group tags (\"鹿家人\", \"新粉\")\n\nBOTTOM ACTION BAR:\n- Text input field with placeholder \"说点什么...\"\n- Smiley face emoji button\n- Heart-shaped gift box button (pink gradient)\n- Pink gift package button\n- Three-dot menu button\n\nSTYLE: Photorealistic, high quality, live streaming interface design, douyin/tiktok live style, interactive elements, vibrant but soft color scheme, engaging social media aesthetic, commercial photography quality."], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 52, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "title": "CLIP 文本编码器 (正面提示词)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [425.0843811035156, 305.1905822753906], "pos": [355.62701416015625, 121.86399841308594], "id": 6, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.75", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.2.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [42], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "size": [361.0684509277344, 104.07720184326172], "pos": [-69.04393768310547, 116.4474105834961], "widgets_values": ["z_image_turbo_bf16.safetensors", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "unet_name"}, "name": "unet_name", "label": "unet_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "unet_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "weight_dtype"}, "name": "weight_dtype", "label": "weight_dtype", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "weight_dtype"}], "flags": {}, "id": 16, "type": "UNETLoader", "title": "unet 加载器", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.75", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.2.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "UNETLoader"}, "order": 3}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "workflowRendererVersion": "LG", "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.37.11", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [-17.8387056154